---
import V0Layout from "@/layouts/V0Layout.astro";
---

<V0Layout
  meta_title="sandikodev — The Roots (2014-2020)"
  description="The foundational fragments of sandikodev's journey — from 3rd grade SD tinkerings to formal engineering."
>
  <div class="v0-banner">
    <span class="v0-breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">sandikodev.github.io</a><span>/</span>
      <a href="/v0">v0</a><span>/</span>
      <span>legacy</span>
    </span>
    <span class="v0-label"
      >Foundational Fragments — The undocumented years.</span
    >
    <a class="v0-link" href="/v0">← Version history</a>
  </div>

  <div class="legacy-container">
    <header class="legacy-header">
      <div class="glitch-wrapper">
        <h1 class="glitch" data-text="THE ROOTS">THE ROOTS</h1>
      </div>
      <p class="legacy-period">Circa 2009 — 2020</p>
    </header>

    <div class="legacy-grid">
      <section class="legacy-section">
        <h2 class="section-title">{"//"} The Early Seeds (SD)</h2>
        <div class="legacy-card">
          <p>
            It began in 2nd grade with hardware — taking apart legacy <strong
              >Pentium 2</strong
            > systems. By 3rd grade, the hardware curiosity turned into digital consistency.
            Writing tips and tricks about computer optimization on <strong
              >Blogspot</strong
            >.
          </p>
          <div class="fragment-list">
            <span>Google AdSense experimentation</span>
            <span>Free software distribution hub</span>
            <span>Visual Design & 3D Modeling (Blender/Sketchup)</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="legacy-section">
        <h2 class="section-title">{"//"} The Investigation (SMP)</h2>
        <div class="legacy-card">
          <p>
            Expanding to Kaskus and Facebook. Learning <strong
              >Meta Pixel</strong
            >
            and digital marketing before it was a mainstream career. Customizing Blogspot
            scripts led to a deep dive into <strong>WordPress</strong>.
          </p>
          <p class="security-note">
            This period introduced the "darker" side of the web: security
            research, dorking, and understanding vulnerabilities from the inside
            out — a period that built my deep technical intuition.
          </p>
          <div class="fragment-list">
            <span>PHP / WordPress Themes</span>
            <span>Web Vulnerability Research</span>
            <span>Social Engineering & Scripting</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="legacy-section">
        <h2 class="section-title">{"//"} The Formalization (SMK)</h2>
        <div class="legacy-card">
          <p>
            Entering Computer and Network Engineering (SMK). Structural
            understanding aligned with years of ad-hoc tinkering. Moving beyond
            PHP into modern frameworks.
          </p>
          <div class="fragment-list">
            <span>Ruby on Rails (Inspired by Bukalapak's peak era)</span>
            <span>Laravel / CodeIgniter</span>
            <span>Hugo / Gatsby / Static Site Generators</span>
            <span>Cloud Deployment (Heroku / Netlify)</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>

    <footer class="legacy-footer">
      <p>
        "Legally, this is the summary of a journey. A transition from a hidden
        digital world into a professional, directed, and responsible future."
      </p>
      <div class="binary-decor">
        01110010 01101111 01101111 01110100 01110011
      </div>
    </footer>
  </div>
</V0Layout>

<style>
  .legacy-container {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 4rem 1.5rem 8rem;
    font-family: "Fira Code", "SF Mono", monospace;
  }

  .legacy-header {
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .glitch-wrapper {
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .glitch {
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: #a78bfa;
    position: relative;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .legacy-period {
    color: rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.5);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .legacy-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3.5rem;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #a78bfa;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .legacy-card {
    background: rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.03);
    border: 1px solid rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.1);
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text-body);
  }

  .legacy-card strong {
    color: #a78bfa;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .security-note {
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    padding-left: 1rem;
    border-left: 2px solid rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.3);
  }

  .fragment-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .fragment-list span {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    background: rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.08);
    color: rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.8);
    padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.2);
    border-radius: 4px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .legacy-footer {
    margin-top: 6rem;
    text-align: center;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.1);
    padding-top: 3rem;
  }

  .legacy-footer p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-style: italic;
    max-width: 60ch;
    margin: 0 auto 2rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .binary-decor {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    color: rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.2);
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .glitch {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
